WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.304
Today your child builds a sentence, one word at a time.

2
00:00:03.754 --> 00:00:06.333
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:08.677
The top line is only one word.

4
00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:12.431
The next line starts again, and adds a word. The cat.

5
00:00:12.881 --> 00:00:14.795
Then one more word. The cat sat.

6
00:00:15.245 --> 00:00:17.036
And one more. The cat sat on.

7
00:00:17.486 --> 00:00:20.470
It goes on to the last line. The cat sat on a mat.

8
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:26.094
Each time, your child goes back to the start. So the first words are read again and again.

9
00:00:26.544 --> 00:00:30.736
By the last line, those first words need no sounding out. They just come.

10
00:00:31.186 --> 00:00:34.190
After the last line, say: hear how smooth that was?

11
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:41.266
Read the first pyramid together. Then your child reads two more alone, and circles the picture that fits each one.

12
00:00:41.716 --> 00:00:44.729
At the end, your child reads one whole sentence to you.
